      "ko": "Discussion",
      "sourceHash": "5eb6cf647d2c5d14a044e2d103dcef4cf0cdc872434c374debc1043092bc4746",
      "status": "preserved"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0001",
      "source": "This property specifies the duration, in seconds, that the [`AVCaptureTimecodeGenerator`](avcapturetimecodegenerator.md) will attempt to synchronize with a timecode source before timing out if synchronization cannot be achieved.",
      "ko": "이 속성은 시간 코드 소스와 동기화할 수 없을 때, [`AVCaptureTimecodeGenerator`](avcapturetimecodegenerator.md)가 동기화 시도를 중단 없이 계속하다가 타임아웃되기 전까지 허용되는 기간(초)을 지정합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "671c28648e0c74fee96daf6772c8e42b60d4a7247073a9b2f599dea865de5841",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0002",
      "source": "If this threshold is exceeded, the synchronization status updates to reflect a timeout, and your [`timecodeGenerator(_:transitionedTo:for:)`](avcapturetimecodegeneratordelegate/timecodegenerator(_:transitionedto:for:).md) delegate method fires, informing you of the event.",
      "ko": "이 임계값이 초과되면 동기화 상태가 타임아웃을 반영하도록 업데이트되고, [`timecodeGenerator(_:transitionedTo:for:)`](avcapturetimecodegeneratordelegate/timecodegenerator(_:transitionedto:for:).md) 대리자 메서드가 호출되어 해당 이벤트를 알려줍니다.",
      "sourceHash": "edd964a487a22fee52b8b98a8eaaaa414bc7ba1bbb1d79bc094b178c97da2687",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0003",
      "source": "The default value is 15 seconds.",
      "ko": "기본값은 15초입니다.",
      "sourceHash": "7d21064d038294fc949ddf440cec40d159c1ed7931ef18c047c2fea3e15330de",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
